ob.24.4\">Jb 24:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַטּוֹת צַדִּיק בַּמִּשְׁפָּט</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.5\">Pr 18:5</a>; here belongs prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַטֹּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:2\" href=\"/Exodus.23.2\">Ex 23:2</a> (E; abs.), perhaps ins. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁפָּט</span> (cf. Bu<sup> ZAW xi. (1891), 113</sup> Ry<sup>ad loc.</sup>)."}],"num":"g."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>thrust away</em>, of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַל־תַּט בְּאַף עַבְדֶּ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:9\" href=\"/Psalms.27.9\">ψ 27:9</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲוֹנוֹתֵיכֶם הִטּוּ־אֵלֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:25\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.25\">Je 5:25</a> <em>your iniquities have thrust away</em> (deprived you of) these (harvests)."}],"num":"h."}],"num":"3."}],"occurrences":"75","form":"Hiph."}]},"rid":"BDB06264","strong_numbers":["5186"],"next_hw":"יֻטָּה²","prev_hw":"נַ֫חַת³","root":true,"occurrences":"215","quotes":[],"GK":["5742"],"TWOT":["1352"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}